    "• OCR / 翻译可在「服务」页添加密钥、设默认并验证连接；大模型可按需开启流式输出。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• On the Services page, add OCR/translation keys, set defaults, and verify connections. Enable streaming for LLMs when needed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• OCR / 翻译可在「服务」页添加密钥、设默认并验证连接；大模型可按需开启流式输出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 全局快捷键可在各功能设置页修改，也可一键恢复推荐方案；延时截图时屏幕中央会显示倒计时。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Change global hotkeys on each feature’s settings page, or restore the recommended set in one click. Delayed capture shows a countdown at screen center."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 全局快捷键可在各功能设置页修改，也可一键恢复推荐方案；延时截图时屏幕中央会显示倒计时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 重要结果状态会以系统通知提示（需允许通知）；菜单栏图标可打开功能菜单与偏好设置。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Important result status uses system notifications (allow Notifications). The menu bar icon opens the feature menu and preferences."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 重要结果状态会以系统通知提示（需允许通知）；菜单栏图标可打开功能菜单与偏好设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 首次使用请授权「屏幕录制」；划词与模拟粘贴需要「辅助功能」；带麦录制需「麦克风」。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• On first use, grant Screen Recording; selection and simulated paste need Accessibility; mic recording needs Microphone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 首次使用请授权「屏幕录制」；划词与模拟粘贴需要「辅助功能」；带麦录制需「麦克风」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
