    "SnapFlow — 点击打开菜单；功能也可通过快捷键触发" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow — Click for the menu; features are also available via keyboard shortcuts"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow — 点击打开菜单；功能也可通过快捷键触发"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SnapFlow 是一款 macOS 菜单栏工具。截一段屏幕、认出图里的字、对照多服务译文、录下一段操作，或找回刚才复制的内容，都可用全局快捷键完成，不必在各个应用之间来回切换。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow is a macOS menu bar utility. Capture a screen region, recognize text in images, compare multi-service translations, record a workflow, or recover something you just copied — all via global hotkeys, without switching apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow 是一款 macOS 菜单栏工具。截一段屏幕、认出图里的字、对照多服务译文、录下一段操作，或找回刚才复制的内容，都可用全局快捷键完成，不必在各个应用之间来回切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SnapFlow 自有文件会一并删除；若文件已被移动，则只删除历史记录。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow-owned files will also be deleted; if the file was moved, only the history entry is removed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow 自有文件会一并删除；若文件已被移动，则只删除历史记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SnapFlow 设置" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SnapFlow 需要屏幕录制权限以进行区域截图、OCR 与屏幕翻译。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow needs Screen Recording permission for region capture, OCR, and screen translation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow 需要屏幕录制权限以进行区域截图、OCR 与屏幕翻译。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SnapFlow 需要辅助功能权限以读取划选文本（划词翻译），并将剪切板历史自动粘贴回原应用。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow needs Accessibility permission to read selected text (selection translate) and paste clipboard history back into the original app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow 需要辅助功能权限以读取划选文本（划词翻译），并将剪切板历史自动粘贴回原应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SnapFlow 需要麦克风权限，以便在屏幕录制时采集你的旁白或讲解声音。拒绝后仍可录制视频与系统声音。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapFlow needs Microphone permission to capture your narration during screen recording. You can still record video and system audio if you decline."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
